  "body": "Step 8 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#process-a-navigate-fetch handles CSP checks for `form-action`. Step 9 handles redirects, but does so by repeating step 9, thereby skipping the CSP check. We shouldn't skip that check.\r\n\r\nThat said, it's not clear to me how best to refactor 8-12. 11 in particular seems obviated by the combination of 9 and 10?",
